      {
        "id": "d5030000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Please answer Yes or No to each question. If you answer Yes to any of them, please speak to your doctor before your first session and tell them the kind of training you plan to do. We will start training with you once your doctor has said it is safe, and we will follow any advice they give.",
        "alignment": "left",
        "runs": [
